WEBVTT - Project Nova Epilogue

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
You came back. The system remembers what you brought with you.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The lights stayed on. The work of keeping them lit goes on.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
There were people waiting. Every return has a story.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
One ship was enough to make a difference. There is still another flight ahead.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Humanity is still growing colder. The next delivery still matters.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Your flight is recorded. Your choices remain.
